5,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must look at the past. What happened to the last three rollouts?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I worry about the budget. Let us check the capital budget and software allowance.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to know about network coverage at customer plants. It seems risky.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I need to see the time lost to copying existing records.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I am concerned about staffing. Let us look at the staffing of the coordination group.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Daisuke, the budget is important, but history tells us what fails.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"Yes, but if the money is frozen, nothing matters.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Ryuji, copying records sounds tedious. Is it really that bad?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,It is a daily drain. I will verify the numbers.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, history is useful, but we need to know who does the work.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,Agreed. We need both the pattern and the capacity.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will also check the vendor licence pricing versus fixed-fee work.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I will look at in-house developer availability. Who is actually free?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will also check the record of cross-unit standardization efforts.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will check the handling of vendor queries. It seems repetitive.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,Let us proceed with these investigations.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
