35,2,1,talk,Servas,,The last three rollouts show a clear pattern. Daily entry tools were dropped.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The capital line is frozen, but the software allowance has room.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Sakura,,Half the customer plants have no signal in the afternoon. That is a problem.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,We lose an hour daily copying records. It is significant.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The coordination group is understaffed. Two people do all the work.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Daisuke, so we can fund software, but not hardware?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"Yes. The allowance is available, but the capital is not.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Ryuji, if we stop copying, we save time. But who builds the tool?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,The developers are busy with the accounting upgrade until Q3.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Sakura, that is the issue. We have no free hands to build.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,The standardization efforts mostly failed without an owner.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,Vendor licences climb with every department added. Fixed-fee is stable.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Sakura,,The outside integrator left the interfaces undocumented. That is risky.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,The narrow tools for one trade still run. The broad ones failed.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Asuka,,The vendor queries are repetitive. The same certificate is requested again and again.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,We need a tool that is narrow and owned by a specific group.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,We must avoid per-head licensing costs.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Sakura,,We cannot rely on external developers.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"We need to solve a specific, daily pain point.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Asuka,,We need to ensure the coordination group can maintain it.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
